":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xz2gvZztOXKsLCkP3KOEUoRtQnH.jpg"},{"id":1599760,"name":"Cloé Heinrich","role":"Eleonore von Breuning (child)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9HfIqbB49vqKvg1VKtoEjoB0v6F.jpg"},{"id":2139117,"name":"Tatiana Nekrasov","role":"Magdalena van Beethoven","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rhSHNB00VysooXV6H5RPcGBBkwF.jpg"},{"id":1481080,"name":"Gabriela Lindl","role":"Susanne Neefe","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y61Ff2XBVCzPyxRAGk3BXHwXsxH.jpg"},{"id":88442,"name":"Claudio Caiolo","role":"Lorenzo Da Ponte"},{"id":2910517,"name":"Lisa Fertner","role":"Konstanze Mozart"},{"id":2910518,"name":"Mahalia Horvath","role":"Magd Konstanze"},{"id":1052314,"name":"Alexander Jagsch","role":"Kaiser Josef II.","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpW7EPPtdRnQia5FF8ULchDu4PN.jpg"},{"id":1599265,"name":"Noemi Krausz","role":"Amalie","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2guNAraF04Qi1gsmV9wEA1PYrcl.jpg"},{"id":2910520,"name":"Laura Sophia Landauer","role":"Gräfin von Taxis","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/prDgn3vOfoWbYuH1QRVajjycT2P.jpg"},{"id":1193609,"name":"Levin Liam","role":"Graf Spee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mH8yb881TCJF9YbsE3zgFr50vx4.jpg"},{"id":1745023,"name":"Dominik Maringer","role":"Graf Waldstein","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2143wJbilYKnlYkdZqdx5lC84X8.jpg"},{"id":2036107,"name":"Harry Schäfer","role":"Max Franz","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/er6G4WuPgdseZEcvnBFENOxhDFA.jpg"},{"id":1554247,"name":"Marie Schöneburg","role":"Madame Grossmann","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xkXXdqi5hUqsz4Iz4ePEXuFRgoh.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"1779. Ludwig van Beethoven, chiamato da tutti Louis, ha solo otto anni ma è già molto conosciuto per il suo talento musicale. Facendosi strada a modo proprio (tra lo sgomento di chi lo circonda), Louis ha modo anni dopo di lasciarsi coinvolgere dal genio creativo di Mozart e dagli sconvolgimenti dettati dalla Rivoluzione Francese…"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"1779. Eight-year-old Ludwig van Beethoven, called \"Louis\", is already known as a musical prodigy. He learns to go his own way - much to the dismay of the people around him. Some years later, he meets Mozart during times of political upheaval. The unconventional genius and French Revolution are sparking a fire in Louis' heart; he doesn't want to serve a master - only the arts. Facing times of family tragedies and unrequited love, he almost gives up. However, Louis makes it to Vienna to study under Haydn in 1792, and the rest is history. Who was this man, whose music has since touched countless hearts and minds? At the end of his life, the master is isolated by loss of loved ones and hearing. Surely though, he was way ahead of his times."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Bonn, 1779. Der achtjährige Louis van Beethoven wächst im provinziellen Bonn auf und gilt als musikalisches Wunderkind. Die Versuche seines Vaters Jean den Jungen zu unterrichten, scheitern. Der Sänger und Schauspieler Tobias Pfeiffer und der Bonner Hoforganist Christian Gottlob Neefe nehmen sich des jungen Genies an und prägen es auf höchst unterschiedliche Weise. Ludwig lernt, eigene Wege zu gehen, eckt damit aber in der Gesellschaft an."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qiMpBl1Ny5lyxlyTvOmYjpo0Lv4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AaqagGDIlA7UT6RrszfF7ZLiOCl.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":761772,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2f4B8DTmes5HMFpRqHvSERaPkUp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/